{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מָאן","hw":"מָאן","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מָאן</span>]</big></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:19\" href=\"/Ezra.7.19\">Ezr 7:19</a></sup> <strong>vessel, utensil (</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">מׇ(א)ן</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܳܐܢ</span>, so Chr-Pal., Schulth<sup>Lex. 106</sup>; Old Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מאן</span>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מנם</span>; poss. √ <span dir=\"rtl\">אנה</span>, v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, אנה\" href=\"/BDB,_אנה\", dir=\"rtl\">II. אנה</a>, cf. Lag<sup>BN 183</sup> Buhl<strong>)</strong>;—pl., <em>vessels</em> of temple at Jerus.: emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָאנַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:14\" href=\"/Ezra.5.14\">Ezr 5:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:15\" href=\"/Ezra.5.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:19\" href=\"/Ezra.7.19\">7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">Dn 5:23</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָאנֵי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:3\" href=\"/Daniel.5.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:5\" href=\"/Ezra.6.5\">Ezr 6:5</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מְגִלָּה²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מֵאמַר²"}